{%- comment -%}
  Bubble Mousse / DRSAMI — Thank You (COD) page.
  Rendered after EasySell submits a real Shopify COD order and redirects
  the buyer to /pages/thank-you-cod.

  Primary CRO objective: INCREASE COD confirmation-call pickup rate.

  Rules baked into this section:
    - Everything is scoped under `#ty-cod` (no global CSS bleed).
    - Theme header/footer are hidden via `body.template-page-thank-you-cod`.
    - No pixel / analytics / fetch / beacon is fired from this section.
    - The commitment CTA is a pure UI toggle stored in localStorage.
    - No form submits, no /cart/add, no /checkout, no order mutation.
    - Real Bubble Mousse assets are reused (bottle photo, usage infographic,
      customer avatars). No fake barcode / QR / rating / percentage.
    - Static/fallback order summary today; DOM has data-hooks so a future
      hydration script can populate it without changing markup.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign wa_number       = section.settings.whatsapp_number   | default: '971542585701'
  assign call_window     = section.settings.call_window       | default: 'أقل من 10 دقائق'
  assign call_prefix     = section.settings.call_prefix       | default: '+971'
  assign product_title   = section.settings.product_title     | default: 'شامبو بابل موس'
  assign bottle_alt      = 'عبوة بابل موس الأصلية'
-%}

<div
  id="ty-cod"
  class="ty"
  dir="rtl"
  lang="ar"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
>

  {%- comment -%} ========== 1. SUCCESS + URGENCY (above the fold) ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ty-hero" aria-labelledby="ty-hero-title">
    <div class="ty-hero__inner">
      <span class="ty-success" role="status">
        <svg class="ty-success__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        <span>تم استلام طلبك بنجاح</span>
      </span>

      <h1 id="ty-hero-title" class="ty-hero__title">
        طلبك تم حجزه بنجاح <span aria-hidden="true">🎉</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="ty-hero__urgent">
        <span class="ty-hero__urgent-ic" aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>
        <span>طلبك محجوز من آخر الكميات المتوفرة</span>
      </p>

      <p class="ty-hero__next" aria-label="الخطوة التالية">
        <span class="ty-hero__next-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>باقي خطوة واحدة فقط</span>
        <span class="ty-hero__next-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ========== 2. CONFIRMATION CALL CARD + COMMITMENT CTA ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ty-section ty-section--tight" aria-labelledby="ty-call-title">
    <div class="ty-call" data-ty-commitment>
      <div class="ty-call__row">
        <span class="ty-call__ic" aria-hidden="true">📞</span>
        <div class="ty-call__row-body">
          <strong>بنتصل بك خلال {{ call_window }}</strong>
          <span>خلّك قريب من جوالك.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ty-call__row">
        <span class="ty-call__ic" aria-hidden="true">👩</span>
        <div class="ty-call__row-body">
          <strong>موظفة من خدمة العملاء</strong>
          <span>لتأكيد الاسم والعنوان قبل الشحن.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ty-call__row ty-call__row--prefix">
        <span class="ty-call__ic" aria-hidden="true">🇦🇪</span>
        <div class="ty-call__row-body">
          <strong>رقم إماراتي يبدأ بـ <span class="ty-prefix" dir="ltr">{{ call_prefix }}</span></strong>
          <span>إذا شفت رقم <span dir="ltr">{{ call_prefix }}</span> غير محفوظ، رد عليه لتأكيد طلبك.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="ty-call__reinforce" id="ty-call-title">
        عشان نحافظ على حجز طلبك، رد على مكالمة التأكيد.
      </p>

      {%- comment -%}
        Commitment CTA — pure UI toggle. No form, no fetch, no beacon,
        no analytics. Persistence is client-side only (localStorage).
        The button uses type="button" to guarantee it can never submit
        a parent form even if wrapped accidentally in the future.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="ty-cta"
        data-ty-commit-btn
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <span class="ty-cta__default">
          <span aria-hidden="true">✅</span>
          <span>طلبي صحيح وسأرد على الاتصال</span>
        </span>
